  "text": "Most launch videos bury the demo. This one starts with the person who built it. I'm Ada Park, and I make LaunchClip. It turns one recording into a finished Short. Edits take twelve minutes, not two days. Captions, punch-ins and callouts come straight from the words. Try it on your next launch."
